{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415043","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415043","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041504301:1":{"text":"요즘 기분이 좋은 모양이네.","source_cn":"看起来你最近过得不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F38C75C7339BC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504302:1":{"text":"역시 너가 나를 계속 지켜보고 있었구나!","source_cn":"啧！我就知道人群中盯着我的熟悉视线是你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B51DE5C3543EFEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504303:1":{"text":"왜 계속 쫓아오는 거야? 귀찮지도 않아?","source_cn":"为什么一直盯着我？烦不烦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE4535F40D60452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504304:1":{"text":"선장님이 너를 바다 밑바닥에서 끌어 올렸을 때도 같은 말을 했지.","source_cn":"你刚从海里被船长捞上来的时候，也说了这句话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BED9651824C6BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504305:1":{"text":"시끄러워. 예전 얘기는 꺼내지도 마!","source_cn":"够了，别和我提以前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB912EA0022402B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504306:1":{"text":"그때 가까이 오지 말라고 했잖아? 언니라고 부를 생각도 없다고 했어!","source_cn":"我还说过别靠近我，我不想叫你姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A3F8084EF26408","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504307:1":{"text":"또 계속 쳐다보기만 해? 그럼 나도 보는 눈 상관 안 하고 가만 안 둘 거니까!","source_cn":"再盯着我，我也不管这里是不是别人的地盘了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452F9388577E7BBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504308:1":{"text":"어차피 선장도 날 신경 안 써. 그러니까 하고 싶은 대로 해도 되겠지 뭐!","source_cn":"反正现在船长也管不了我，我想干什么，就可以干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB464E7B6F1D2C8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504309:1":{"text":"안 그래도 계속 네 눈동자가 갖고 싶었거든, 꺄하하...!","source_cn":"你的眼珠子，我想要很久了哈哈哈……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x794C3D0238F635C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504310:1":{"text":"눈동자 따위, 네가 원한다면 내 몸이 잿더미로 변할 때 얼마든지 내어줄 수 있지.","source_cn":"眼睛而已，既然你想要，等我这具身躯归于灰烬时，来取吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF0E7F730A1AFD73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504311:1":{"text":"...뭐? 이렇게 쉽게 허락한다고?","source_cn":"……嗯？你居然答应了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59B14FE0A00FA0CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504312:1":{"text":"어쨌든 네가 활력 있어 보여서 다행이야.","source_cn":"总之，看到你依然这么有活力，我就放心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C644CE3B790E575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504313:1":{"text":"...? ","source_cn":"……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C15B5912CAA4C17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504314:1":{"text":"미친 소리 그만해. 내 앞에서 언니 행세하지 말라고!","source_cn":"疯婆子，不要在我面前摆姐姐的架子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46268C7475AA8C61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504315:1":{"text":"내 도끼가 피 맛을 본지 좀 됐거든? 오랜만에 휘둘러야 정신을 차리겠어?","source_cn":"我的斧子很久没沾血了，你想尝尝吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55174E8513D942F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041504316:1":{"text":"내 화살도 꽤 정확해.","source_cn":"我的箭准头也很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F2317D634464AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504317:1":{"text":"꺄하하, 그럼 한 판 붙어보자고!","source_cn":"哈哈哈，那就来打一架吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x402E9D099AEEB23B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504318:1":{"text":"마침 두드려 패주고 싶었으니까!","source_cn":"我想揍你很久了！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC19107D30C77FF67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:波妮":{"text":"보니","source":"波妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}